{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1095525-seeing-if-there-is-any-interest-in-a-changeling-20th-game","id":1095525,"title":"Seeing if there is any Interest in a Changeling 20th game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-22T10:02:15-07:00","id":1095525,"title":"Seeing if there is any Interest in a Changeling 20th game","content":"Seeing if there is any Interest in a Changeling 20th game to be played over Goggle docs and Skype; this would be a text only game with Goggle docs being used for the main body of the stories and Skype being used as OOC type thing; there would really need to be a day that people play on as long people let others know they have written in the doc others can reply - though I will have to limit back editing to only the current scene. I would also be open to just doing play by post -<br /> <br /> While I am half waiting to see what sort of characters I will have to deal with before I get more soild setting details I do have some and some over all plot ideas<br /> <br /> The basic story will start in a small holding in the Duchy of the Four Winds that is just out side the lands controlled by the Queen herself. The ruling Noble is about to pass on and the land is largely with out an heir as the story starts the Count declares that he will hold a group of events and that any who pass they will become his heirs be they Noble or Commoner; Seelie or Unseelie; from near or far.<br /> <br /> The players would be people who are here to try there hand to wind the title [though if no one does/wants to that is fine as well - I've got NPCs for that <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ]. <br /> <br /> I would prefer people a re the normal Kiths, Though I could be talked in to some from the back of the book... with in reason. <br /> <br /> If there are any question or comments let me know; if you are interested I would like if you posted just a quick concept so maybe other who want to play could work together at Char Gen","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/324-ardenty","name":"ardenty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar324_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T16:54:39-07:00","id":1095659,"title":"","content":"Would be super interested provided the timing worked out, as that's almost always the issue. I've had an idea for a Arcadian Sidhe that recently returned, probably a gallant knight type. Really all they know is they were betrayed in Arcadia and that recently got them booted, the catch being, with time being wonky in Arcadia; is that while they don't know the details of the betrayal, they are certain that person is already here, and it could litteraly be anyone (probably an NPC Noble).<br /> <br /> Looking forward to see this develop.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1043,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1043-mrmarkers","user":"MrMarkers","date":". 05-22-2017, 07:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1043-mrmarkers","name":"MrMarkers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1043_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T17:16:38-07:00","id":1095674,"title":"","content":"yeah I've had problems with time issues before which is why I went with skype/goggle docs - the docs can be edited by and one I add to them and as long as they mention they edited the doc the other people can re-edit it when they have time.<br /> <br /> In games I've done before the only real problem was people editing 'in the past' and not telling any one [there is an option to see revisions but at times its annoying to check if things are moving fast] <br /> <br /> Timing is also one of the reason I wouldn't be apposed to doing a play by post thing here on the forums [in fact the skype/doc is pretty much this to start with any way <br /> <br /> I'm fine with the Sidhe - one of the original idea I had was an All Sidhe game given the house make it easy to make different enough [and now that there are two breeds of them], but I decided to open it up to all Kiths","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/324-ardenty","name":"ardenty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar324_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}